WEBVTT

00:18:57.819 --> 00:19:00.339
CA: Have you been hanging out
with Ray Kurzweil by any chance?

00:19:00.339 --> 00:19:03.552
NN: No, but I've been hanging
around with Ed Boyden

00:19:03.552 --> 00:19:05.397
and hanging around with one of the speakers

00:19:05.397 --> 00:19:07.210
who is here, Hugh Herr,

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.107
and there are a number of people.

00:19:09.107 --> 00:19:10.504
This isn't quite as far-fetched,

00:19:10.504 --> 00:19:13.449
so 30 years from now.

00:19:13.449 --> 00:19:15.191
CA: We will check it out.

00:19:15.191 --> 00:19:17.493
We're going to be back and we're going
to play this clip 30 years from now,

00:19:17.493 --> 00:19:20.524
and then all eat the red pill.

00:19:20.524 --> 00:19:22.709
Well thank you for that.

00:19:22.709 --> 00:19:24.153
Nicholas Negroponte.

00:19:24.153 --> 00:19:25.501
NN: Thank you.

00:19:25.501 --> 00:19:26.315
(Applause)